# ::tok The report believes that the content ecology of the e - commerce industry is a comprehensive concept that integrates e - commerce with content , but not all content can be integrated with e - commerce . Good PGC ( professional production of content ) and UGC ( user original content ) are the high - quality carriers for integration with e - commerce . The higher the value of the content platform , the richer the consumption and promotion scenarios , the higher the possibility of e - commerce implantation , and the stronger the commercial value , the higher the proportion of e - commerce content production and content consumption that are gradually integrated and distributed in the public and private sectors .
