# ::tok He said that he should deeply study and implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping 's important speech at the opening ceremony of the seminar , more firmly support the " two establishment” and resolutely achieve " two maintenance” , strengthen his skills , do hard work , and firmly promote the various tasks of Chinese - style modernization , and create achievements that can stand the test of history , practice and the people in building a modern socialist country in an all - round way and promoting the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation in an all - round way .
