# ::tok The full - time description of the characters and emotional lines is very amazing . Some characters are only brought occasionally , and they will leave a deep impact on people . For example , the more focused characters Ye Xiu , Huang Shaotian , Su Mucheng have a large number of fans , and the characters who are not in the center of the writing , such as Jiang Botao , Chu Yunxiu , etc. , are also very popular . In an e - sports article , people ca n't find a character that is extremely annoying . This is the success of full - time character writing .
